WEBVTT

00:09:29.876 --> 00:09:33.596
I was told that the reason was
because it was that person's turn,

00:09:33.636 --> 00:09:35.196
which basically means, you know,

00:09:35.196 --> 00:09:37.356
it has to do with how long
you're in the group

00:09:37.396 --> 00:09:38.516
or in the organization.

00:09:38.556 --> 00:09:40.556
And that was really confusing for me

00:09:40.596 --> 00:09:44.196
because I'd been in the organization
for quite a reasonable amount of time

00:09:44.196 --> 00:09:45.916
relative to this person.

00:09:45.916 --> 00:09:48.476
I was certainly more prepared
in terms of experience,

00:09:48.516 --> 00:09:50.756
education and all of those things.

00:09:50.796 --> 00:09:52.796
And it really got me to thinking,

00:09:52.836 --> 00:09:56.876
what exactly is the value
that this organization is seeing in me,

00:09:56.916 --> 00:10:01.316
if in fact I bring everything to the table
and still it's not enough?